- "[…] we got a puppy (she’s 8 months old) last week and since then, my daughter has just been absolutely wild. Coooooonstantly talking, hyper fixated on the dog, doesn’t listen to a single thing, just talks and talks and dances and sings and spins and babbles, she’s just so disregulated, and it’s making me resent her! My daughter not the dog. […]" [ar081-0061]
- "[…] after preschool which started about 3 months ago, everything changed!! […]" [ar011-0136]

