- "Our 3 year old loves to pick his nose.. and the real issue is that he picks it so much that it bleeds. […]" [ar050-0023]
- "[…] we’ve cut her nails short, tried mittens (she pulls them off), tried taping the mittens to her (she still managed to get them off) […]" [ar023-0167]
- "[…] I’m worried she’s going to scar herself, she literally says “picking” whilst she picks at it, […]" [ar023-0167]
- "When he’s mad, like when I take something or say no, he will burst into tears, **and then look around for something to smack his head on.** […]" [ar084-0076]

**But:** The head-hitting account describes a single knock and quick recovery, rather than continuous banging. "He’s not hitting his head over and over, it’s usually just one knock, he tells me he’s okay, and then he recovers. Is this normal?" [ar084-0077]

