- "I'm not sure what to do. I feel really anxious about slipping. Especially since my 3 year old hates showering so much. He kind of freaks out getting his head rinsed and isn't very careful." [ar048-0102]

**But:** nothing found against it.

### The parent objects to a stranger touching the baby during a stressful outing.

1 of 41 posts.

An employee intrudes while the parent calms a tired three-year-old.

