**But:** The parent is actively calming the toddler. "[…] I calm her down in line while I’m handing the smaller items from the cart to my husband to scan. […]" [ar048-0048]

### The writer questions whether parenting or social experience explains public screaming.

1 of 41 posts.

Age is unknown; the pandemic example is another parent’s story.

