**But:** The writer questions their expectations. "[…] I'm genuinely trying to understand if I'm just old-school." [ar074-0007]

### The writer believes discipline and allowing crying prevent later parental distress.

1 of 41 posts.

No child, age, method tried or outcome is identified; this is an assertion.

